<title>USA: Chittenden names Kirk Walters CFO.</title>
<headline>Chittenden names Kirk Walters CFO.</headline>
<dateline>BURLINGTON, Vt. 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chittenden Corp said Thursday that Kirk Walters had been named executive vice president, chief financial officer and treasurer.</p>
<p>Walters was previously chairman, president and chief executive officer of Northeast Federal Corp, Chittenden said.</p>
<p>At Chittenden, Walters replaces Nancy Rowden Brock, who left the company in September to pursue other interests, a company spokeswoman said.</p>
